# paroda: objects in wrong horizontal position

- Source URL: https://github.com/jotego/jtcores/issues/851

In the second stage of Parodius, in the tunnel where the big walking woman appears, when she is walking back to the left, the "hair" sprites of her headdress exchange positions and stay at a distance.
This is until she starts walking to the right and they go back to normal.

